# Settings, all optional for `npm run dev` (cloudflare/.dev.vars, created by
# `npm run configure`). A deployment's values live in cloudflare/.prod.vars and
# are uploaded as Worker secrets by `npm run secrets`. Keep both files private;
# Git ignores them.
#
# There are no sign-in or people settings: Cloudflare Access signs people in to
# a deployment, `npm run dev` has no sign-in, and the two names and emails are
# entered in the app at its first sign-in.
# Phone push: a stable VAPID keypair (changing it breaks existing subscriptions)
# and a contact. Without PUSH_CONTACT, the app's own address is used.
VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# PUSH_CONTACT=mailto:you@example.com
# Optional shared iCloud calendar: an Apple app-specific password, never the account password.
# ICLOUD_USERNAME=
# ICLOUD_APP_PASSWORD=
# ICLOUD_CALENDAR_NAME=Household
# ICLOUD_CALENDAR_URL=
# Optional ChatGPT connection, written by `npm run ai:connect`.
# CHATGPT_HOST_ID=
# CHATGPT_MODEL_ID=
# CHATGPT_CREDENTIAL_JSON=
